UniCLStrat::constructor(DeploymentConfig _params)
├── Given registry in config is zero
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientZeroRegistry
├── Given any required address in config is zero (weth, pool, factory)
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratZeroAddress
├── Given the configured pool does not contain WETH
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidPool
├── Given the configured pool is not returned by factory.getPool(token0, token1, fee)
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidPool
├── Given positionWidth is zero
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given rebalanceTickThreshold is zero
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given maxTickDeviation is zero
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given twapInterval is less than MIN_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given twapInterval is greater than MAX_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given shortTwapInterval is less than MIN_SHORT_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given shortTwapInterval is greater than MAX_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given pool.observe cannot serve twapInterval
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratPoolTWAPNotAvailable
├── Given pool.observe cannot serve shortTwapInterval
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratPoolTWAPNotAvailable
├── Given in-use observationCardinality is below MIN_OBSERVATION_CARDINALITY
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInsufficientObservationCardinality
├── Given maxSwapSlippageBps exceeds MAX_SLIPPAGE_BPS
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
└── Given valid parameters
    ├── It should chain RegistryClient(_params.addresses.registry) in the constructor modifier list
    ├── It should store registry reference via RegistryClient (immutable after deploy)
    ├── It should set immutable integration addresses (pool, factory, WETH)
    ├── It should identify the paired token
    ├── It should set strategy configuration
    ├── It should set swap paths and slippage
    ├── It should set genesisTimestamp
    └── It should approve token0 and token1 to the Converter

UniCLStrat::registry()
└── It should return the protocol Registry address (set in constructor)

UniCLStrat::receive() external payable
└── Given ETH is sent to the strategy
    ├── It should accept ETH
    └── It should include the ETH balance in navInETH

UniCLStrat::metadata views
├── Given name is queried
│   └── It should return Uniswap Concentrated Liquidity Strategy
├── Given genesisTimestamp is queried
│   └── It should return deployment timestamp
├── Given totalDeposited is queried
│   └── It should return cumulative ETH deposits
└── Given totalWithdrawn is queried
    └── It should return cumulative ETH withdrawals

UniCLStrat::navInETH()
├── Given the strategy has native ETH balance
│   └── It should include native ETH one-to-one
├── Given the strategy has WETH balance
│   └── It should include WETH one-to-one
├── Given the strategy has paired token balance
│   └── It should convert paired token value through the oracle
├── Given the strategy has active pool positions
│   └── It should include liquidity and tokens owed from the pool
└── Given the strategy has no balances or positions
    └── It should return zero

UniCLStrat::maxDeposit()
├── Given pool spot or short TWAP is outside maxTickDeviation
│   └── It should return zero
├── Given current NAV is greater than or equal to maxTotalNAV
│   └── It should return zero
└── Given strategy is calm and below capacity
    └── It should return maxTotalNAV minus current NAV

UniCLStrat::maxWithdrawal()
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should return zero
└── Given strategy has NAV and is not paused
    └── It should return navInETH

UniCLStrat::isHealthy()
├── Given pool is not calm
│   └── It should return false
├── Given ticks have not been initialized
│   └── It should return true
├── Given current tick is outside the main position range
│   └── It should return false
├── Given current tick deviates from center by more than rebalanceTickThreshold
│   └── It should return false
└── Given current tick is calm and within threshold
    └── It should return true

UniCLStrat::deposit()
├── Given caller is not the registered StrategyManager
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given msg.value is zero
│   └── It should revert with StrategyZeroDeposit
├── Given post-receipt NAV would exceed maxTotalNAV
│   └── It should revert with StrategyMaxDepositExceeded
├── Given msg.value equals remaining headroom to maxTotalNAV
│   └── It should accept the deposit (msg.value already counted in navInETH)
├── Given pool is not calm
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratNotCalm
├── Given spot tick diverges from long TWAP within maxTickDeviation
│   └── It should size mint liquidity at spot and complete deposit
└── Given caller is the registered StrategyManager and amount is valid
    ├── It should increase totalDeposited
    ├── It should wrap received ETH into WETH
    ├── It should poke then accrue pending LP fees before remove/collect
    ├── It should remove and collect existing liquidity
    ├── It should balance inventory through swaps when needed
    ├── It should initialize ticks if needed
    ├── It should add liquidity to valid positions
    └── It should emit FundsDeposited

UniCLStrat::investIdleETH()
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should revert with EnforcedPause
├── Given strategy has no native ETH balance
│   └── It should return zero
├── Given pool is not calm
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratNotCalm
└── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE and idle native ETH is present
    ├── When idle native ETH exceeds maxDeposit()
    │   ├── It should deploy only maxDeposit() and leave the remainder as native ETH
    │   └── It should emit FundsInvested with the capped amount
    ├── It should wrap idle native ETH into WETH
    ├── It should poke then accrue pending LP fees before remove/collect (same as deposit)
    ├── It should deploy wrapped ETH into liquidity (same path as deposit)
    ├── It should NOT emit HighWatermarkUpdated
    └── It should emit FundsInvested with idle native ETH amount only (excludes collected fees re-deployed in the same call)

UniCLStrat::withdraw(address _receiver, uint256 _amount)
├── Given caller is not the registered StrategyManager
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given receiver is zero address
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratZeroAddress
├── Given amount is zero
│   └── It should revert with StrategyZeroWithdrawal
├── Given amount exceeds current NAV
│   └── It should revert with StrategyMaxWithdrawalExceeded
├── Given caller is the registered StrategyManager and idle native ETH covers the requested amount
│   ├── It should fulfil a withdrawal sourced entirely from idle native ETH
│   ├── It should send the payout directly from the native balance without wrapping or unwrapping
│   ├── It should not interact with the pool or the Converter
│   ├── It should leave the LP position and WETH/paired inventory untouched
│   ├── It should increase totalWithdrawn
│   ├── It should emit FundsWithdrawn
│   └── It should return the ETH amount actually sent to the receiver
└── Given caller is the registered StrategyManager and idle native ETH falls short of the requested amount
    ├── It should put all idle native ETH toward the payout
    ├── It should poke then accrue pending LP fees into the performance-fee base before remove/collect
    ├── It should remove and collect existing liquidity
    ├── It should convert inventory to WETH only up to the remainder not covered by idle native ETH
    ├── It should cap withdrawal at idle ETH plus available WETH when oracle/swap prices diverge
    ├── It should increase totalWithdrawn
    ├── It should unwrap only the WETH remainder to ETH
    ├── It should send ETH to receiver in a single native transfer
    ├── It should rebalance remaining inventory only if pool is calm
    ├── It should re-add liquidity only if pool is calm
    ├── It should still complete the unwind and payout when the pool is not calm (re-add skipped)
    ├── It should emit FundsWithdrawn
    └── It should return the ETH amount actually sent to the receiver

UniCLStrat::rebalance()
├── Given caller is not the registered StrategyManager
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given strategy is healthy
│   └── It should revert with StrategyIsHealthy
├── Given pool is not calm
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratNotCalm
├── Given spot tick diverges from long TWAP within maxTickDeviation
│   └── It should size mint liquidity at spot and complete rebalance
└── Given caller is the registered StrategyManager and strategy is unhealthy but calm
    ├── It should poke then accrue pending LP fees before remove/collect
    ├── It should remove and collect existing liquidity
    ├── It should set new main and alternate ticks around the current tick
    ├── It should balance inventory
    ├── It should add liquidity to valid positions
    └── It should emit Rebalanced

UniCLStrat::sync()
├── Given caller is not the registered StrategyManager
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should revert with EnforcedPause
└── Given caller is the registered StrategyManager and strategy is not paused
    ├── It should poke main and alternate positions with burn(..., 0) when liquidity is deployed
    ├── It should materialize accrued fees into tokensOwed without calling collect
    ├── It should NOT flush LP-fee counters (pending reads the live tokensOwed - snapshot delta)
    ├── It should not rebalance inventory or re-add liquidity
    └── It should emit Synced

UniCLStrat::pause()
├── Given caller has neither ADMIN_ROLE nor SECURITY_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientCallerHasNoneOfRoles
├── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE or SECURITY_ROLE and the pool is healthy
│   ├── It should pause the strategy
│   ├── It should remove and collect existing liquidity
│   └── It should revoke Converter token allowances
├── Given the pool is degraded (positions, burn, or collect reverts)
│   ├── It should still pause the strategy
│   ├── It should still revoke Converter token allowances
│   └── It should emit LiquidityUnwindSkipped
├── Given the paired token rejects zero approval
│   ├── It should still pause the strategy
│   ├── It should still revoke the WETH Converter allowance
│   ├── It should leave the paired token's Converter allowance unchanged
│   └── It should emit ConverterAllowanceRevocationSkipped for the paired token
├── Given WETH rejects zero approval
│   └── It should revert
└── Given the pause-time liquidity unwind was skipped and the pool has recovered
    └── It should remove and collect the remaining pool liquidity on unpause() followed by pause()

UniCLStrat::selfRemoveLiquidityAndCollect()
├── Given caller is not the strategy itself
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratCallerNotSelf
└── Given caller is the strategy itself
    ├── It should poke then accrue pending LP fees before remove/collect
    └── It should remove and collect existing liquidity

UniCLStrat::selfRevokePairedTokenConverterAllowance()
├── Given caller is not the strategy itself
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratCallerNotSelf
└── Given caller is the strategy itself
    └── It should revoke the paired token's Converter allowance

UniCLStrat::pendingPerformanceFeeInETH(uint256 _performanceFeeBps)
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should return zero (fee counters preserved)
├── Given strategy is not paused and has uncharged LP fees already materialized
│   └── It should return uncharged LP fees in ETH * feeBps / BASIS_POINTS
├── Given fee growth exists only as unpoked pending (not yet in tokensOwed)
│   └── It should return zero until sync or a remove/collect path pokes
└── Given performanceFeeBps is zero or nothing is pending
    └── It should return zero

UniCLStrat::settlePerformanceFee(uint256 _performanceFeeBps)
├── Given caller is not the registered StrategyManager
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientInvalidCaller
├── Given strategy is paused
│   └── It should return zero without charging counters
├── Given strategy is not paused and has uncharged LP fees
│   ├── It should accrue already-materialized tokensOwed into the fee base (no poke)
│   ├── When feeETH rounds to zero (feeBaseETH * bps / BASIS_POINTS == 0)
│   │   ├── It should return zero
│   │   ├── It should NOT advance charged counters
│   │   └── It should leave the dust feeable once the base grows large enough
│   ├── When feeETH is non-zero
│   │   ├── It should mark uncharged LP fees as charged
│   │   ├── It should emit PerformanceFeeSettled
│   │   └── It should return the ETH-denominated fee amount
├── Given fee growth exists only as unpoked pending
│   └── It should return zero (matches pendingPerformanceFeeInETH)
└── Given performanceFeeBps is zero or nothing is pending
    └── It should return zero

UniCLStrat::emergencyExit()
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given strategy is not paused
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratNotPaused
├── Given the pool is still degraded
│   ├── It should still sweep on-contract native ETH, WETH, and paired token balances
│   └── It should accrue with snapshot fallback (no-op) then set charged = earned
├── Given the pause-time liquidity unwind was skipped
│   ├── It should not touch the pool
│   ├── It should leave the LP position in the pool, still attributed to the strategy via navInETH()
│   └── It should accrue then set charged = earned so resume does not re-charge already-charged fees
├── Given pause-time Converter allowance revocation was skipped
│   └── It should still unwrap WETH and send native ETH to strategyManager
├── Given paired-token transfer reverts (blacklist / pause)
│   ├── It should still unwrap WETH and send native ETH to strategyManager
│   ├── It should emit PairedTokenTransferSkipped
│   ├── It should leave paired-token balance on the strategy
│   ├── It should still write off pending LP fees and emit EmergencyExited
│   └── It should transfer paired tokens on a later emergencyExit once the token is transferable
├── Given paired-token balanceOf reverts
│   ├── It should still unwrap WETH and send native ETH to strategyManager
│   ├── It should emit PairedTokenTransferSkipped
│   ├── It should leave paired-token balance on the strategy
│   └── It should transfer paired tokens on a later emergencyExit once balanceOf succeeds
├── Given paired-token transfer succeeds with no return data (USDT-style)
│   ├── It should still unwrap WETH and send native ETH to strategyManager
│   ├── It should transfer paired tokens to strategyManager (trySafeTransfer treats empty returndata as success)
│   └── It should emit EmergencyExited without PairedTokenTransferSkipped
├── Given paired-token transfer returns false
│   ├── It should still unwrap WETH and send native ETH to strategyManager
│   ├── It should emit PairedTokenTransferSkipped
│   └── It should leave paired-token balance on the strategy
└── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE on Registry and strategy is paused
    ├── It should unwrap all WETH to native ETH
    ├── It should combine unwrapped WETH with any pre-existing native ETH balance
    ├── It should send combined native ETH to strategyManager first
    ├── It should best-effort transfer all paired tokens to strategyManager as ERC-20
    ├── It should write off pending LP fees (try-accrue then charged = earned) so only post-reset fee growth is feeable
    ├── It should emit EmergencyExited with native ETH amount only
    └── It should leave zero native ETH and WETH balances on the strategy

UniCLStrat::setTwapInterval(uint32 _newTwapInterval)
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given new interval is below MIN_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given new interval is above MAX_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given pool.observe cannot serve the new interval
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratPoolTWAPNotAvailable (storage unchanged)
├── Given in-use observationCardinality is below ceil(newInterval / MAX_BLOCK_SECONDS)
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInsufficientObservationCardinality (storage unchanged)
└── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE and the pool can serve the interval
    └── It should update twapInterval and emit TwapIntervalUpdated

UniCLStrat::setShortTwapInterval(uint32 _newShortTwapInterval)
├── Given caller does not have ADMIN_ROLE on Registry
│   └── It should revert with RegistryClientMissingRole
├── Given new interval is below MIN_SHORT_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given new interval is above MAX_TWAP_INTERVAL
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidConfig
├── Given pool.observe cannot serve the new interval
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratPoolTWAPNotAvailable (storage unchanged)
└── Given caller has ADMIN_ROLE and the pool can serve the interval
    └── It should update shortTwapInterval and emit ShortTwapIntervalUpdated

UniCLStrat::uniswapV3MintCallback(uint256 _amount0, uint256 _amount1, bytes _data)
├── Given caller is not the pool
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratCallerNotPool
├── Given caller is pool but strategy is not minting
│   └── It should revert with UniCLStratInvalidMintCallback
└── Given deposit mints a pool position
    └── It should complete the callback path without reverting

UniCLStrat::StrategyManager integration
├── Given strategy is registered in StrategyManager
│   └── It should be included in strategy count and NAV views
├── Given StrategyManager deposits to all strategies via depositToStrategies
│   ├── It should deposit into UniCLStrat
│   ├── It should update totalDeposited
│   └── It should expose strategy NAV through StrategyManager
├── Given StrategyManager deposits directly into UniCLStrat
│   ├── It should deposit the sent ETH amount
│   └── It should keep strategy healthy
├── Given StrategyManager withdraws from UniCLStrat
│   ├── It should send ETH to controller
│   ├── It should update totalWithdrawn
│   └── It should reduce strategy NAV
├── Given StrategyManager checks an unhealthy UniCLStrat
│   └── It should call rebalance and restore health
└── Given UniCLStrat is not healthy or cannot accept deposits
    └── It should be skipped by StrategyManager depositToStrategies

UniCLStrat::fuzz invariants
├── Given a bounded valid deposit amount
│   ├── It should track totalDeposited exactly
│   └── It should keep NAV approximately equal to deposited value
└── Given bounded valid deposit and withdrawal amounts
    ├── It should transfer requested ETH to receiver
    ├── It should track totalWithdrawn exactly
    └── It should reduce NAV by the withdrawn amount
